target the opposition goal, or simply reduce your opponents to scrap metal and walk the ball home. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/647640/extras/e2893701bbde9d269c9d03b5635b9c9f.poster.avif?t=1734432341\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/647640/extras/e2893701bbde9d269c9d03b5635b9c9f.webm?t=1734432341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/647640/extras/e2893701bbde9d269c9d03b5635b9c9f.mp4?t=1734432341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Customisation</strong><br>ShockRods allows for full customisation of your nimble war machines. Change your car body style, colour, and patterns. Select from a wide range of wheel and tyre combos. Choose from a host of taunt FX and sounds, and much more, to show off your flair and style as you dominate your opponents. All the content is cosmetic and can be unlocked through currency earned in game, based on your performance in battle.  <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/647640/extras/8925e36b9e58da72bd61deb3d26b4156.poster.avif?t=1734432341\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/647640/extras/8925e36b9e58da72bd61deb3d26b4156.webm?t=1734432341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/647640/extras/8925e36b9e58da72bd61deb3d26b4156.mp4?t=1734432341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Weapons and Power-Ups</strong><br>ShockRods brings a full arsenal of explosive (and somewhat unconventional) weapons to aid you in annihilating your opponents. These are placed across the environment for you to collect and put to